                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "5 Years after release and still no reviews...surprising.  This is a very well done VR game.  It has polish and looks professionally done.  It is enjoyable to just pick up and play for a while.  The waves get increasingly more difficult, but it is well balanced and  not overly difficult.\n\nThe only other thing I wish it had was an option to install towers to shoot the invaders so it is more like a good Tower Defense game rather than just another wave shooter.  It doe snot appear that anyone is still working on this project though, so enjoy it for what it is.\n\nI got it on sale for $3.74, and it well worth that price.  I could not say the same thing for the full asking price of $15.",
